Keep a shared state as 0.
Keep a shared value as 0.
Keep a shared group as 0.
Keep a shared result as 0.
To roll.
Set state to state plus 1.
If state is more than 7, set state to 1.

To draw.
Set value to 0.
Repeat while value is less than 1 or value is more than 40.
Roll.
Set group to state minus 1.
Roll.
Set value to group times 7 plus state.
Set result to (value minus 1) modulo 10 plus 1.

Draw.
Show result.
